<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify">(d) payment by any Guarantor of a portion, but not all, of the Obligations shall in no way limit, affect,
