(v)&nbsp;any Secured Party&#8217;s consent to the change, reorganization or termination of the corporate or other organizational structure or existence of any Note Party and to any corresponding restructuring of the Obligations; (vi)&nbsp;any
failure to perfect or continue perfection of a security interest in any collateral which secures any of the Obligations; (vii)&nbsp;any defenses (other than the defense of Payment in Full), <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">set-offs</FONT> or
