 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify"><B>Section</B><B></B><B>&nbsp;2.05</B> <B><U>Guarantors&#8217; Rights of
