 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify"><B>Section</B><B></B><B>&nbsp;2.06</B> <B><U>Subordination of Other
Obligations</U></B>. Any Indebtedness of any Note Party or any Grantor now or hereafter held by any Grantor (such Grantor, an &#8220;<U>Obligee Grantor</U>&#8221;) is hereby subordinated in right of payment to the Obligations, and any such
