<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify"><B>Section</B><B></B><B>&nbsp;2.07</B> <B><U>Continuing Guaranty</U></B>. This Guaranty is a continuing guaranty and shall
