<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify"><B>Section</B><B></B><B>&nbsp;2.08</B> <B><U>Authority of Guarantors or Note Parties</U></B>. It is not necessary for the
Agent or any other Secured Party to inquire into the capacity or powers of any Guarantor or any Note Party or the officers, directors, managers, trustees or agents acting or purporting to act on behalf of any of them. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify"><B>Section</B><B></B><B>&nbsp;2.09</B> <B><U>Financial Condition of the Issuers</U></B>. The Notes may be issued and sold by
